OL,3,GNEWSACotswold tourism, is it a blessing
OL,4,Aor a burden?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith autumn in full swing, the West of
OL,7,FEngland is a popular region for
OL,8,Ftourists to make cosy getaways, with
OL,9,Fthe chocolate box villages of the
OL,10,FCotswolds proving particularly popular.
OL,12,FBut, with the post-pandemic rise in
OL,13,Fvisitors in some areas, tensions have
OL,14,Frisen in villages such as Bibury.
OL,16,FThe village is home to about 600 people
OL,17,Fbut can see up to 20,000 visitors a
OL,18,Fday, with fences having to be installed
OL,19,Fto stop tourists paddling in the river.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
