OL,3,GNEWSACotswold tourism, is it a blessing
OL,4,Aor a burden?
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwenty-four miles away, in Painswick,
OL,7,FCarol Maxwell said that while there are
OL,8,Fan "awful lot" of tourists in the
OL,9,Fvillage, there is a balance with most
OL,10,F"really nice and appreciative".
